<div class="aw-content">
  <p class="aw-scene" data-scene></p>
  <button type="button" data-action="editing" aria-pressed="true">Editing on</button>
  <div class="aw-tools" role="group" aria-label="Drawing material">
    {{#each tools}}<button type="button" data-action="tool" data-layer="{{layer}}" aria-pressed="false">{{label}}</button>{{/each}}
  </div>
  <div class="aw-modes" role="group" aria-label="Drawing mode">
    {{#each modes}}<button type="button" data-action="mode" data-mode="{{mode}}" aria-pressed="false">{{label}}</button>{{/each}}
  </div>
  <button type="button" data-action="finishLine" hidden>Finish line (Enter)</button>
  <div class="aw-row" data-size-controls>
    <label>Brush / door width <input type="number" min="2" max="2048" step="1" data-diameter aria-label="Brush diameter"></label>
  </div>
  <div class="aw-row" data-light-controls hidden>
    <label>Color <input type="color" data-light-color aria-label="Light color"></label>
    <label>Radius <input type="number" min="0.1" max="1000" step="0.5" data-light-range aria-label="Light radius in grid squares"></label>
  </div>
  <p class="aw-help">Rectangle: drag opposite corners to draw four straight edges. Paint: drag a merged outline. Line: click the start, then click each corner; Enter or Esc finishes. Moving the mouse adds no vertices.</p>
  <p class="aw-help">Right drag or Space + left drag pans. Middle drag erases a rectangle. Wheel resizes Paint; Ctrl + wheel zooms. Ctrl + Z undoes an edit. Doors and windows use a straight opening; lights use a click.</p>
  <div class="aw-layers" role="group" aria-label="Visible and editable layers">
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-visible="walls" checked> Walls</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-visible="doors" checked> Doors</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-visible="invisible" checked> Invisible</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-visible="windows" checked> Windows</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" data-visible="lights" checked> Lights</label>
  </div>
  <div class="aw-row"><button type="button" data-action="undo">Undo edit</button><span class="aw-help" data-count></span></div>
  <p class="aw-help">Completed edits save directly to the scene. No grid or endpoint snapping. Hidden layers are protected from erasing. Pause editing to play normally.</p>
  <p class="aw-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-status></p>
</div>
